      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبُوطٌ</span></b>  <i>A declivity,</i> or <i>declinal place, a place
of descent,</i> or <i>by which one descends,</i> (S, Msb,
K;) <i>a place which brings one down from a higher
to a lower place.</i> (Az, TA.)

